      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This report describes the echocardiographic diagnosis of right atrial thromboembolism with histopathological validation after successful surgical removal. Since serious and often fatal complications are common with this disease, we recommend urgent surgical intervention on the basis of the echocardiographic findings."},
